flowchart TD
  Launch[Launch] --> Gate{First run?}
  Gate -->|Yes| Onboard[Three-slide onboarding]
  Onboard --> Storage[iCloud or device-only storage]
  Storage --> Home[Home]
  Gate -->|No| Home
  Home <--> Tasks[Tasks]
  Tasks <--> Goals[Goals]
  Goals <--> Home
  Home --> Summary[Daily Summary]
  Home --> Settings[Settings]
  Settings --> Archive[Archived Goals]
  Settings --> Model[BYOM configuration]
  Home --> Add[Add action]
  Tasks --> Add
  Goals --> Add
  Add --> Compose[Brain Dump: type or dictate]
  Compose <--> Preview[Live interpretation, not saved]
  Compose -->|Process| Processing[Final interpretation]
  Processing -->|Cancel| Compose
  Processing --> Review[Review and Confirm]
  Review -->|Back| Compose
  Review -->|Looks Good!| Save[Persist accepted items]
  Save --> Origin[Return to originating tab]
  Goals --> Detail[Goal detail]
  Home --> Detail
  Detail --> Timeline[Timeline]
  Detail --> Calendar[35-day calendar]
  Detail --> Log[Quick entry or written note]
  Detail --> Lifecycle[Rename, archive, delete]
